  Placement: 2
  CardStory: "It doesn\u2019t help that there is much more to remember. \r\n\r\nAssignments
    are rotated constantly, sometimes more than once a day. 2Spade can barely keep
    up with it. Orders are given erratically, through different channels and at random
    times. Twice, he is given details by four different officers. Sometimes he finds
    himself doing copy work in the archives while someone from the research division
    trains in the arms court. *Why? No matter.* \r\n\r\nEverything slows as the whole
    company struggles to adapt. The pattern keeps changing. *I can make it out eventually.*"
